(6537072, 972849, 96751, '<td valign="top">The moment here is very special, and I like the silhouetting.  But something is a bit odd with the processing.  There is ghosting of some sort around every object in the image, which has a severe negative impact on the technical quality.  And although I really like the colors, I feel that the image could have been much brighter, without loosing the end of day feeling.  The sun caught in the branches is splendid.</td>', 'The moment here is very special, and I like the silhouetting.  But something is a bit odd with the processing.  There is ghosting of some sort around every object in the image, which has a severe negative impact on the technical quality.  And although I really like the colors, I feel that the image could have been much brighter, without loosing the end of day feeling.  The sun caught in the branches is splendid.', '2011-09-12 02:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
