(6537667, 972535, 108580, '<td valign="top">Stunning, As smooth as a babies, well, you know. Love the position of the legless man and his two ghosts :) You? Super work, concept and execution. Front page.</td>', 'Stunning, As smooth as a babies, well, you know. Love the position of the legless man and his two ghosts :) You? Super work, concept and execution. Front page.', '2011-09-12 16:08:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6537673, 972893, 108069, '<td valign="top">Great photo. Such a sincere portrait that''s really well executed with managing all the light. Nice stuff.</td>', 'Great photo. Such a sincere portrait that''s really well executed with managing all the light. Nice stuff.', '2011-09-12 16:12:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6537678, 972817, 108069, '<td valign="top">Wow. Stunning shot. Would I be off my rocker if I were to guess it is this beautiful spot?<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=964853" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1415/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_964853.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1415/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_964853.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1415/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_964853.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>I recall the sun setting in roughly that area. Apologies if I''m wrong, or for even guessing. Just taking a stab.<br/> <br/>Simply beautiful image with flawless execution.</td>', 'Wow. Stunning shot. Would I be off my rocker if I were to guess it is this beautiful spot?   I recall the sun setting in roughly that area. Apologies if I''m wrong, or for even guessing. Just taking a stab. Simply beautiful image with flawless execution.', '2011-09-12 16:16:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6537682, 972465, 108069, '<td valign="top">Pretty dang funny. Cool photo as well.</td>', 'Pretty dang funny. Cool photo as well.', '2011-09-12 16:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6537684, 972724, 108069, '<td valign="top">I would have over-edited this. Awesome shot and very nice processing. Should be a strong finish for you in about a week.</td>', 'I would have over-edited this. Awesome shot and very nice processing. Should be a strong finish for you in about a week.', '2011-09-12 16:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6537685, 972602, 108069, '<td valign="top">Great title. Lovely photo. Beautiful.</td>', 'Great title. Lovely photo. Beautiful.', '2011-09-12 16:19:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6537686, 972499, 108069, '<td valign="top">National Geographic-esque. Awesome photo with stunning tones and a killer pose. Excellent.</td>', 'National Geographic-esque. Awesome photo with stunning tones and a killer pose. Excellent.', '2011-09-12 16:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6537713, 972753, 108580, '<td valign="top">Fabulous lighting and composition. The fisherman''s rod as he is hauling in is also perfect. Love it.</td>', 'Fabulous lighting and composition. The fisherman''s rod as he is hauling in is also perfect. Love it.', '2011-09-12 16:39:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6537714, 972716, 108580, '<td valign="top">Just breathtaking. Front page. Simple minimal elements and lovely form. The sky trail also adds a hint of additional mysticism. Hope it''s scoring well.</td>', 'Just breathtaking. Front page. Simple minimal elements and lovely form. The sky trail also adds a hint of additional mysticism. Hope it''s scoring well.', '2011-09-12 16:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
