(6537891, 972724, 124982, '<td valign="top">Quite stunning. Really like the composition and colors on this one. Only comment I''d make is maybe a little more contrast on the sky/clouds would bring out a more dramatic feel to it.</td>', 'Quite stunning. Really like the composition and colors on this one. Only comment I''d make is maybe a little more contrast on the sky/clouds would bring out a more dramatic feel to it.', '2011-09-12 22:03:35.000000', NULL, 1),
