(6538380, 972883, 108069, '<td valign="top">Nice reflected clouds and a cool, moody scene. Nice how the clouds spiral up and away from the sun. Despite it''s minimal presence (bright-wise) it forms a bit of a hub for the entire scene. Nice photo.</td>', 'Nice reflected clouds and a cool, moody scene. Nice how the clouds spiral up and away from the sun. Despite it''s minimal presence (bright-wise) it forms a bit of a hub for the entire scene. Nice photo.', '2011-09-13 11:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
