(6538419, 972438, 138253, '<td valign="top">Almost looks like a painting! Great job on capturing such a fantastic scene of nature.<br/>My only critique would be that the branches in the top right detract slightly from the sky - if possible i would have tried to remove them from the frame with something (rope/branch to pull or lift them).</td>', 'Almost looks like a painting! Great job on capturing such a fantastic scene of nature.My only critique would be that the branches in the top right detract slightly from the sky - if possible i would have tried to remove them from the frame with something (rope/branch to pull or lift them).', '2011-09-13 12:37:06.000000', NULL, 1),
