(6539473, 972369, 114233, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing this is Dwayne <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=80831" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">wizardry</a>. Nice shot and I anticipate it will do well - maybe a bit higher than a 6.7 so about 0.7 above your average. I am currently about 0.7 above my average too... so good luck to you and may the best man win :-)<br/>I probably would have tried to frame it a bit more to the left. The RHS feels a bit empty to me... the rocks on the left are cut off, the sun is a bit central and the water on the right is void of interest. Nit picking of course as I have already said it is a nice shot!<br/>PS - didnt vote</td>', 'I''m guessing this is Dwayne  wizardry. Nice shot and I anticipate it will do well - maybe a bit higher than a 6.7 so about 0.7 above your average. I am currently about 0.7 above my average too... so good luck to you and may the best man win :-)I probably would have tried to frame it a bit more to the left. The RHS feels a bit empty to me... the rocks on the left are cut off, the sun is a bit central and the water on the right is void of interest. Nit picking of course as I have already said it is a nice shot!PS - didnt vote', '2011-09-14 09:06:12.000000', NULL, 1),
