(6540857, 972663, 108069, '<td valign="top">Nice texture and vibrant colors. Odd scene as well, which is always interesting.<br/> <br/>I over-edit as a rule, so here''s how I would have ruined this: First off, I maybe would have gotten lower and a bit further away from the boat to give it a deeper, vast feel, and I would have toned down the red in the clay/lake bed/whatever to make it look even dryer than it is, then dodged and burned the cracks to get them to pop a bit more and add a deeper feel to the image. Probably also desaturated it a bit to also play up the stark nature of the landscape and scene in general.<br/> <br/>But those are just editing preferences. It''s a great find and a great idea.</td>', 'Nice texture and vibrant colors. Odd scene as well, which is always interesting. I over-edit as a rule, so here''s how I would have ruined this: First off, I maybe would have gotten lower and a bit further away from the boat to give it a deeper, vast feel, and I would have toned down the red in the clay/lake bed/whatever to make it look even dryer than it is, then dodged and burned the cracks to get them to pop a bit more and add a deeper feel to the image. Probably also desaturated it a bit to also play up the stark nature of the landscape and scene in general. But those are just editing preferences. It''s a great find and a great idea.', '2011-09-15 10:40:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6540858, 972717, 108069, '<td valign="top">Impressive. Awesome shot. Amazing detail and beautiful.</td>', 'Impressive. Awesome shot. Amazing detail and beautiful.', '2011-09-15 10:40:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6540887, 972418, 108069, '<td valign="top">Beautiful rays. Such a great scene it looks as though it''s been designed.</td>', 'Beautiful rays. Such a great scene it looks as though it''s been designed.', '2011-09-15 11:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
