(6541007, 972493, 96751, '<td valign="top">There is an odd dichotomy in this image - It''s so lovely I keep thinking it should be "softer", and yet there is a harshness.</td>', 'There is an odd dichotomy in this image - It''s so lovely I keep thinking it should be "softer", and yet there is a harshness.', '2011-09-15 13:49:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6541223, 972673, 104230, '<td valign="top">Lovely in B&amp;W ~ puts the emphasis on the textures and composition.</td>', 'Lovely in B&W ~ puts the emphasis on the textures and composition.', '2011-09-15 19:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6541229, 972581, 104230, '<td valign="top">Evokes a certain mood very well.  A slight quibble, to my eyes the reflection of the sun is a distraction. My eye keeps going back and forth between the sun and its reflection since they are the two brightest parts of the image.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-09-19 11:55:58.</i></td>', 'Evokes a certain mood very well.  A slight quibble, to my eyes the reflection of the sun is a distraction. My eye keeps going back and forth between the sun and its reflection since they are the two brightest parts of the image.', '2011-09-15 19:18:24.000000', '2011-09-19 12:55:58.000000', 1),
(6541313, 972819, 107410, '<td valign="top">You''ve got some sensor dust that you need to clone out.</td>', 'You''ve got some sensor dust that you need to clone out.', '2011-09-15 21:37:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6541314, 972883, 107410, '<td valign="top">What''s with the water in the foreground? On the right it looks like a relatively smooth pond, in the middle it looks like wet cement, and on the left it looks like a flowing river...?<br/> <br/>Other than that, the temperature is too cool for my liking, I would''ve preferred to see you warm this up a bit.</td>', 'What''s with the water in the foreground? On the right it looks like a relatively smooth pond, in the middle it looks like wet cement, and on the left it looks like a flowing river...? Other than that, the temperature is too cool for my liking, I would''ve preferred to see you warm this up a bit.', '2011-09-15 21:39:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6541316, 972867, 107410, '<td valign="top">The colors seem a bit flat for what seems to have been a very nice sunset. I also would have cloned out the car in the bottom right corner to give this a stronger feeling of solitude.</td>', 'The colors seem a bit flat for what seems to have been a very nice sunset. I also would have cloned out the car in the bottom right corner to give this a stronger feeling of solitude.', '2011-09-15 21:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6541318, 972801, 107410, '<td valign="top">I would have preferred to see this shot much closer to the subjects. To me, since they are so far away, they are more of a distraction than a benefit to the image. I feel like there is a story here...it looks as if they are searching for something?</td>', 'I would have preferred to see this shot much closer to the subjects. To me, since they are so far away, they are more of a distraction than a benefit to the image. I feel like there is a story here...it looks as if they are searching for something?', '2011-09-15 21:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6541319, 972493, 107410, '<td valign="top">Very very classy. 10</td>', 'Very very classy. 10', '2011-09-15 21:45:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6541320, 972732, 107410, '<td valign="top">On my monitor, there is some strange noise or artifacting starting at the horse on the right and into the forest in the background.</td>', 'On my monitor, there is some strange noise or artifacting starting at the horse on the right and into the forest in the background.', '2011-09-15 21:48:28.000000', NULL, 1),
