(6543012, 972708, 59737, '<td valign="top">just barely in frame but it''s there all the same, don''t know if it''s possible to shoot from further to the right but getting the sun closer to the bridge and leaving out some of what''s on the left would be better from my opinion</td>', 'just barely in frame but it''s there all the same, don''t know if it''s possible to shoot from further to the right but getting the sun closer to the bridge and leaving out some of what''s on the left would be better from my opinion', '2011-09-17 11:09:25.000000', NULL, 1),
