(6543216, 971888, 137320, '<td valign="top">Well photographed, a truly beautiful shot. I do wish there was a little warmth to the sunlight</td>', 'Well photographed, a truly beautiful shot. I do wish there was a little warmth to the sunlight', '2011-09-17 14:53:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6543226, 972464, 137320, '<td valign="top">I love the idea of this, just not in love with the treatment. The concept requires the viewer to get the feeling of an overwhelming power. I think this could have been better achieved with increased contrast (levels or curves) and a touch of brightness to the roses to highlight the sun''s impact to the rose petals and the "life" of the greens. A little modification would have earned another point or two, but I still really enjoyed this photograph!</td>', 'I love the idea of this, just not in love with the treatment. The concept requires the viewer to get the feeling of an overwhelming power. I think this could have been better achieved with increased contrast (levels or curves) and a touch of brightness to the roses to highlight the sun''s impact to the rose petals and the "life" of the greens. A little modification would have earned another point or two, but I still really enjoyed this photograph!', '2011-09-17 15:08:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6543228, 972009, 137320, '<td valign="top">I really enjoyed this one. Nice composition.</td>', 'I really enjoyed this one. Nice composition.', '2011-09-17 15:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6543230, 972783, 137320, '<td valign="top">Oh wow. This is extraordinary. You should be very proud</td>', 'Oh wow. This is extraordinary. You should be very proud', '2011-09-17 15:11:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6543233, 972801, 137320, '<td valign="top">Very touching photograph. I would have named it something different to help it "tell a story", but I still very much enjoyed it!</td>', 'Very touching photograph. I would have named it something different to help it "tell a story", but I still very much enjoyed it!', '2011-09-17 15:13:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6543239, 972820, 107410, '<td valign="top">Is this how you saw the image when you were standing there? The colors seem like they should have been so vivid yet the processing on you image makes everything feel flat. I really enjoy the composition, I can feel the movement in the water, and the sky is perfectly exposed, BUT I feel like you could have done so much more to accentuate the warm side-ish lighting falling on the bridge and in the left foreground. I can absolutely see what caught your eye to make you stop and take this photo, but the post processing doesn''t seem to do it justice.</td>', 'Is this how you saw the image when you were standing there? The colors seem like they should have been so vivid yet the processing on you image makes everything feel flat. I really enjoy the composition, I can feel the movement in the water, and the sky is perfectly exposed, BUT I feel like you could have done so much more to accentuate the warm side-ish lighting falling on the bridge and in the left foreground. I can absolutely see what caught your eye to make you stop and take this photo, but the post processing doesn''t seem to do it justice.', '2011-09-17 15:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6543241, 972609, 107410, '<td valign="top">There is some haloing around the church and the foreground is too cluttered in this case (perhaps because it is in B&amp;W).</td>', 'There is some haloing around the church and the foreground is too cluttered in this case (perhaps because it is in B&W).', '2011-09-17 15:23:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6543242, 972152, 107410, '<td valign="top">I love the simplicity.</td>', 'I love the simplicity.', '2011-09-17 15:23:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6543244, 971895, 107410, '<td valign="top">The horizon does not appear to be straight.</td>', 'The horizon does not appear to be straight.', '2011-09-17 15:25:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6543245, 972535, 107410, '<td valign="top">Lovely view of Diamond Head, you''ll have to show me were this spot it sometime!</td>', 'Lovely view of Diamond Head, you''ll have to show me were this spot it sometime!', '2011-09-17 15:25:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6543247, 972506, 107410, '<td valign="top">I like seeing the rays of light coming through the clouds, but it looks like you bumped up the clarity too much so instead of the sky staying a lovely even blue with lighter rays, you have a strangely uneven sky that almost looks dirty. I love the processing on the lake, trees, and foreground however.</td>', 'I like seeing the rays of light coming through the clouds, but it looks like you bumped up the clarity too much so instead of the sky staying a lovely even blue with lighter rays, you have a strangely uneven sky that almost looks dirty. I love the processing on the lake, trees, and foreground however.', '2011-09-17 15:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6543248, 972302, 137320, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting one. Judging from the title, I get the idea that you want the photo to convey warmth and comfort. I think this could have been better achieved with increased saturation and skewing the color balance more toward warm colors. Also noticing that the subject appears to be a little fuzzy anyway, experimenting with soft focus may have been a fun idea to help diminish the relevance of perfect focus as well as help bring a bit more of an ethereal feel to the photograph. I still enjoyed this, and keep at it!</td>', 'This is an interesting one. Judging from the title, I get the idea that you want the photo to convey warmth and comfort. I think this could have been better achieved with increased saturation and skewing the color balance more toward warm colors. Also noticing that the subject appears to be a little fuzzy anyway, experimenting with soft focus may have been a fun idea to help diminish the relevance of perfect focus as well as help bring a bit more of an ethereal feel to the photograph. I still enjoyed this, and keep at it!', '2011-09-17 15:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6543249, 972138, 107410, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately at 800px, I can barely tell that there is a city down there at all...the composition is interesting but not captivating.</td>', 'Unfortunately at 800px, I can barely tell that there is a city down there at all...the composition is interesting but not captivating.', '2011-09-17 15:30:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6543250, 972302, 107410, '<td valign="top">I feel like the woman on the right really detracts from this image.</td>', 'I feel like the woman on the right really detracts from this image.', '2011-09-17 15:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6543252, 972170, 107410, '<td valign="top">Lovely sky, terrible foreground.</td>', 'Lovely sky, terrible foreground.', '2011-09-17 15:34:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6543254, 971809, 137320, '<td valign="top">I would have liked a little more work done with the color balance. Love the composition though. Beautiful photograph!</td>', 'I would have liked a little more work done with the color balance. Love the composition though. Beautiful photograph!', '2011-09-17 15:35:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6543255, 972686, 107410, '<td valign="top">Out of curiosity, did you try taking any photos with the young lady facing the camera? Also, your horizon isn''t straight.</td>', 'Out of curiosity, did you try taking any photos with the young lady facing the camera? Also, your horizon isn''t straight.', '2011-09-17 15:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6543256, 972534, 107410, '<td valign="top">Cool flower!</td>', 'Cool flower!', '2011-09-17 15:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6543257, 972724, 137320, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is a stunning photograph. One that you could stare at for hours. There are so many things I like about this, but I will just keep it short and say very well done!</td>', 'Wow, this is a stunning photograph. One that you could stare at for hours. There are so many things I like about this, but I will just keep it short and say very well done!', '2011-09-17 15:37:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6543258, 972820, 137320, '<td valign="top">It''s a little dark and a tad over sharpened. Very beautiful shot though.</td>', 'It''s a little dark and a tad over sharpened. Very beautiful shot though.', '2011-09-17 15:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6543259, 972849, 107410, '<td valign="top">Very lovely shot, this is a shot that many people can identify with and it certainly tells a story. However it appears that something strange happened in post: the dad, basketball, and basketball goal all have ghosting around them that I find extremely distracting.</td>', 'Very lovely shot, this is a shot that many people can identify with and it certainly tells a story. However it appears that something strange happened in post: the dad, basketball, and basketball goal all have ghosting around them that I find extremely distracting.', '2011-09-17 15:39:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6543263, 972851, 107410, '<td valign="top">I wonder if a tighter crop to get rid of most of the negative space at the bottom of the frame would''ve helped this pop.</td>', 'I wonder if a tighter crop to get rid of most of the negative space at the bottom of the frame would''ve helped this pop.', '2011-09-17 15:41:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6543264, 972732, 137320, '<td valign="top">This is gorgeous. The impact of the sun on the horses and field truly stands out and really helps viewers connect with the scene. Absolutely wonderful!</td>', 'This is gorgeous. The impact of the sun on the horses and field truly stands out and really helps viewers connect with the scene. Absolutely wonderful!', '2011-09-17 15:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6543279, 971769, 137320, '<td valign="top">Very interesting treatment on this one. I love the contrast of the trees in the valley, but the high saturation has created a bit of an issue just above the sun. I''m pleased with the low amount of noise on the clouds, I know that can be tough! Well done.</td>', 'Very interesting treatment on this one. I love the contrast of the trees in the valley, but the high saturation has created a bit of an issue just above the sun. I''m pleased with the low amount of noise on the clouds, I know that can be tough! Well done.', '2011-09-17 15:55:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6543301, 972817, 137320, '<td valign="top">Highest rated so far! Lighting and composition is superb!</td>', 'Highest rated so far! Lighting and composition is superb!', '2011-09-17 16:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6543510, 972537, 137320, '<td valign="top">I love how this photo captures the quiet emotion and peacefulness of the woods. Well done!</td>', 'I love how this photo captures the quiet emotion and peacefulness of the woods. Well done!', '2011-09-17 19:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6543565, 972817, 59737, '<td valign="top">beautiful setting, the lighting on the model seems a little strong</td>', 'beautiful setting, the lighting on the model seems a little strong', '2011-09-17 20:03:40.000000', NULL, 1),
