(6544888, 972032, 30364, '<td valign="top">Ahhh!  I can''t look at this without thinking this:<br/> <br/><i>"Welcome my son, welcome to the machine. <br/>What did you dream? It''s alright we told you what to dream."</i> - Floyd.<br/> <br/>So many of your pictures make me think of something else, though in this case I suppose it was the title that nudged me in the right direction.  But imagine that  pictures that make the viewer think of something else!  And not out of desperation (as is the case so often with the pictures at the other end of the challenge results), but instead in a spirit of delight &amp; wonder.<br/> <br/>You are a rare gift to DPC John.  Underappreciated perhaps, but the gift that keeps on giving nonetheless.   Thank you.</td>', 'Ahhh!  I can''t look at this without thinking this: "Welcome my son, welcome to the machine. What did you dream? It''s alright we told you what to dream." - Floyd. So many of your pictures make me think of something else, though in this case I suppose it was the title that nudged me in the right direction.  But imagine that  pictures that make the viewer think of something else!  And not out of desperation (as is the case so often with the pictures at the other end of the challenge results), but instead in a spirit of delight & wonder. You are a rare gift to DPC John.  Underappreciated perhaps, but the gift that keeps on giving nonetheless.   Thank you.', '2011-09-19 07:34:02.000000', NULL, 0),
